  Description: "COMPANION / CRIMSON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nEach Princess talent grants
    this ally +1 projectile, up to +3. Projectile count helps projectile weapons;
    this does not turn a melee weapon into a ranged weapon.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nRun
    / Enemy speed: +10%\nRun / Score multiplier: +10%\nChampion / Maximum health:
    -1\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE
    IN THE WAITING REALM\nAn unhatched sky-dweller who speaks through their shell,
    postponing hatching until their flock is found. The shell is their body, not
    a container to open for a reward. They decide when the next part of their life
    begins.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nOwn weapon damage gains 0.5% per companion body
    in the roster, before later balance modifiers.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies
    and absorbed memories; their stated percentages are not multiplied by star level
    unless explicitly stated. Listed support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nSource:
    dream shop or special reward, subject to hero theme and unlock wave.\r\nBonds:
    clock, regal, morning. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment; two equal-species/equal-star
    bodies merge unless the talent forbids it."
